# Cloudflare Pages / Netlify redirect rules for thecm2.com
#
# These rules enforce:
#  1. HTTP → HTTPS (301 permanent redirect)
#  2. non-www → www (301 permanent redirect)
#
# For Cloudflare Pages: place this file in the /public (dist) output directory.
# For Cloudflare Workers / Full setup: use the wrangler.toml rules below instead.

# non-www → www (catches both http and https non-www)
http://thecm2.com/*    https://www.thecm2.com/:splat    301!
https://thecm2.com/*   https://www.thecm2.com/:splat    301!

# http www → https www
http://www.thecm2.com/*  https://www.thecm2.com/:splat  301!
